{"content":[{"c":["BENJAMIN (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Youngest of Jacob’s 12 sons and full brother to Joseph. Jacob named him Benjamin (“son of my right hand”) after his dying mother Rachel had called him Ben-oni (“son of my sorrow,” ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.35.18","r":"Gen.35.18","rawR":"Gen.35.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.35.18","value":"Gen.35.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 35:18"},"). After Joseph had been sold into Egypt by his half brothers, their father, Jacob, assumed that Joseph was dead and became very protective of Benjamin. Later, with Joseph controlling the plot, Benjamin was used in the reunion in Egypt of Jacob and his 12 sons (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.42.1-45.28","r":"Gen.42.1-45.28","rawR":"Gen.42.1-45.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.42.1-45.28","value":"Gen.42.1-45.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 42–45"},"). When prophesying concerning each of his sons, Jacob spoke of Benjamin’s skill as a warrior or prophesied of the military fame of his descendants by saying, “Benjamin is a wolf that prowls. He devours his enemies in the morning, and in the evening he divides the plunder” (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.49.27","r":"Gen.49.27","rawR":"Gen.49.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.49.27","value":"Gen.49.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"49:27"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=BenjaminTribeof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"BenjaminTribeof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"BenjaminTribeof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Benjamin, Tribe of"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Bilhan’s son and Jacob’s great-grandson (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.10","r":"1Chr.7.10","rawR":"1Chr.7.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.10","value":"1Chr.7.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Member of Harim’s clan of the postexilic community who married a pagan wife (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.32","r":"Ezra.10.32","rawR":"Ezra.10.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.32","value":"Ezra.10.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:32"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One who repaired a section of the wall next to his own house (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.23","r":"Neh.3.23","rawR":"Neh.3.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.23","value":"Neh.3.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One of the company of Jews who participated in the dedication of the wall at Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.34","r":"Neh.12.34","rawR":"Neh.12.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.34","value":"Neh.12.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:34"},"). He may be the same as #4 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BenjaminPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 35:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.35.18","rawQueryValue":"Gen.35.18","sourceRefExact":"Gen.35.18"},{"anchorText":"Gn 42–45","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.42.1-45.28","rawQueryValue":"Gen.42.1-45.28","sourceRefExact":"Gen.42.1-45.28"},{"anchorText":"49:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.49.27","rawQueryValue":"Gen.49.27","sourceRefExact":"Gen.49.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.10"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.32","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.32","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.32"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.23","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.23","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.23"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.34","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.34","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.34"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"4b7cd52603a08251d1660af80e8cebe9be2d7363a737bb5bf779a6a587eb067f","sourceItemName":"BenjaminPerson","sourceItemOrder":187,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BenjaminPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Benjamin (Person)","title":"Benjamin (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}